    /// - `lda`: Leading dimension of two-dimensional array used to store matrix `A`.
    /// - `S`: Real array of dimension `min(m,n)`. The singular values of A, sorted so that `S(i) >= S(i+1)`.
    /// - `U`: &lt;type> array of dimension `ldu * m` with `ldu` is not less than `max(1,m)`. `U` contains the $m \times m$ unitary matrix `U`.
    /// - `ldu`: Leading dimension of two-dimensional array used to store matrix `U`.
    /// - `VT`: &lt;type> array of dimension `ldvt * n` with `ldvt` is not less than `max(1,n)`. `VT` contains the $n \times n$ unitary matrix V\*\*T.
    /// - `ldvt`: Leading dimension of two-dimensional array used to store matrix `Vt`.
    /// - `work`: Working space, &lt;type> array of size `lwork`.
    /// - `lwork`: Size of `work`, returned by `gesvd_bufferSize`.
