    /// $$
    ///
    /// The same as `syevd`, the user has to provide working space pointed by input parameter `work`. The input parameter `lwork` is the size of the working space, and it is returned by `syevj_bufferSize()`. Please note that the size in bytes of the working space is equal to `sizeof(&lt;type>) * lwork`.
